# ---- Aktemto's mine (place $2D, its upper levels: kind $10) ----
# Rock and floor are the caves' (chapter 1), in the olive this mine has: the earth floor gets a line of its own
# here, as in every cave (the game's tint of the shared one turns it green). The timbering, the heaps of ore, the
# ladder and the cask keep their NES shapes in Dragon Quest III's wood and rock.
sq k10:DE5FEDC9DD4DEAE6 dq3t:b5d04690 rows 0-11,2-5 tint 56:52 dark 34 here # the floor
sq k10:B5B4419A63FD7B01 =k10:DE5FEDC9DD4DEAE6 over dq3v:ecf9c237.hi here # treasure chest
sq k10:F0943D0420DFE56E dq3t:30f34ccc tint 55:45 dark 45 here # the rock's face, in shadow
sq k10:6133FC8375682B54 dq3t:30f34ccc tint 55:45 dark 45 here
sq k10:57352E8081AEE208 ~dq3h:bc978def dark 35 here # the timbering: planks
sq k10:E512AEBBC41F08AC ~dq3h:bc978def dark 35 here # and posts
sq k10:3D2A2C4C96A3DDA8 ~dq3h:bc978def dark 35 here
sq k10:16AF477027AC1311 =k10:DE5FEDC9DD4DEAE6 over ~dq3t:52d321d7 clear 1e tint 45:45 here # a heap of ore
sq k10:95675832C93898AD =k10:DE5FEDC9DD4DEAE6 over ~dq3t:316d8b20 clear 1e here # a ladder
sq k10:E8DFD8208E7DFEAA =k10:DE5FEDC9DD4DEAE6 over ~dq3t:316d8b20 clear 1e here # a cask
sq k10:51D4A7A78919EEED =k10:DE5FEDC9DD4DEAE6 over dq3c:75608358.hi here # the stone table
sq k10:E70AE1749FF8DFD6 =k10:DE5FEDC9DD4DEAE6 over ~dq3c:75608358 clear 1e here # and its stone seats

# ---- the ship in Haville's harbour (kind $2F) ----
# Dragon Quest III has no ship's deck. The deck is its plank floor (the rooms' wooden floor, as the NES has it too),
# the rim a lighter wood; sails, mast, cabin roof, rail, barrels and the wheel keep their NES shapes in its wood's
# and cloth's colors until a ship's own art is found (Dragon Quest V opens on one).
